        "id": 8843,
        "name": "NFL 2K1",
        "summary": "NFL 2K1 is the follow-up sequel to the popular NFL 2K for the Dreamcast. NFL 2K1 provides several upgrades to the series, including individual team playbooks, an improved passing model, an improved running game, and online play.\n\nThis game features all 31 NFL teams, season and franchise modes, a practice mode, a play editor, over 2000 motion-captured animations, and the ability to download updated information from the Internet.",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co40uf.jpg",
